        },
        {
          "id": "vernacular-abstracted",
          "status": "forbidden",
          "note": "c01: 'Orders must be executed to a published canon...An order without a full entablature is void.'"
        }
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "status": "drafted",
      "rule": "Executed to a published canon (Vignola) with entasis, correct capital, base and entablature -- c01. Frequently paired or coupled rather than single, which is the style's fastest diagnostic tell against Neoclassical Revival.",
      "note": "Overrides an incorrect cascade: the lineage walk lands on french-vernacular (via a distant reference edge) and forbids the entire classical-apparatus group with a rule true of vernacular farm buildings and false of this style, whose hard constraint c01 makes the order the single most load-bearing fact in the kit.",
      "confidence": "high",
      "judgment": false
    },
